>Another only way to make water is to zap a wand of cancellation at yourself.

If you pile the items which you want to cancel, you can zap the WoC at the
pile.  This has the advantage that you don't need to drop everything else 
(usually you cancel LESS than half your inventory.)
Warnings:  Be sure that the wand will not reflect off a wall back at you.
	I've never tried the next two, but:
		Zapping a WoC at a BoH or a shield/amulet of reflection may
		have undesired effects.

